abstract: >-
  Video-to-room pipeline: frame selection, VGGT-Omega pose prior, SuperPoint+LightGlue
  matching with DINOv2 retrieval, GPU triangulation and bundle adjustment, posed
  Depth Anything 3 depth, metric scale and per-frame scale, gravity-aligned world
  with the floor at zero, TSDF fusion with a visibility map, export, stage gates and a
  provenance manifest.
